Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,250)\blur7.5\be5\1c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\fn@更紗黑體 TC\frz270\pos(1354.5,646.5)}富士覆白衣
